Subject: [PATCH] power: support locking and blanking with the power button

Add lock-screen as a distinct power-button action. MediaKeys captures the
press-time display state and triggers on release; the existing Power manager
owns locking and the normal idle/display transitions. Confirm the requested
Mutter power state before replying, and ignore requests while one is pending.
Retain the four existing action values, defaults, and activation behavior.

